# Kustomize Practice Guide: Directives, Generators & Advanced Patching (CKA / CKAD)

This directory contains a self-contained Kustomize lab designed for hands-on practice with Kubernetes declarative
configuration management, environment overlays, resource generators, image transformers, and advanced patch taxonomy.

Kustomize is natively integrated into `kubectl` (`kubectl kustomize` and `kubectl apply -k`). It allows you to
customize raw, template-free YAML files for multiple environments without altering original baseline manifests.

