## 1. Directory Structure & Pathing Architecture

A clean, modular directory structure isolates base configurations, environment overlays, and reusable patch files:

```text
/home/vagrant/cka/09-kustomize/
├── README.md                          # Master guide explaining all options and directives
├── test-kustomize.sh                  # Non-interactive automated test validation harness
├── base/
│   ├── kustomization.yaml             # Baseline resources declaration
│   ├── configmap.yaml                 # Baseline application configuration
│   ├── secret.yaml                    # Baseline secret manifest
│   ├── deployment.yaml                # Workload referencing webapp-config and webapp-secret
│   └── service.yaml                   # ClusterIP service exposing webapp
└── overlays/
    ├── development/                   # Development environment customizations
    │   ├── kustomization.yaml         # Dev overlay: prefix, annotations, dev generators, JSON patches
    │   ├── dev-settings.properties    # File input for configMapGenerator
    │   ├── dev-app.env                # Key=value env-file source for configMapGenerator
    │   ├── dev-secrets.env            # Sensitive env-file source for secretGenerator
    │   └── patches/                   # Dedicated modular patches folder
    │       ├── patch-memory-replace.yaml # JSON 6902 replace: scales memory request to 32Mi
    │       └── patch-remove-probe.yaml   # JSON 6902 remove: strips livenessProbe for fast dev boot
    └── production/                    # Production environment customizations
        ├── kustomization.yaml         # Prod overlay: suffix, images transformer, strategic merge
        ├── prod-secrets.env           # Sensitive env-file source for secretGenerator
        └── patches/                   # Dedicated modular patches folder
            ├── patch-replicas-ha.yaml # Strategic merge patch: sets 3 replicas & tight limits
            ├── patch-sidecar-add.yaml # JSON 6902 add: injects log-shipper sidecar container (/-)
            ├── patch-env-add.yaml     # JSON 6902 add: appends DB_TIMEOUT env variable (/-)
            └── patch-security-context.yaml # Wildcard patch targeting Deployments via labelSelector
```

