## 2. Comprehensive Kustomize Options Reference

The following table summarizes all core options and directives demonstrated across this lab:

| Directive | Type | Purpose & Behavior |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `resources:` | `[]string` | Resolves paths to baseline manifests (`deployment.yaml`) or base folders (`../../base`). |
| `namespace:` | `string` | Sets the target namespace across all manifests in the overlay. |
| `namePrefix:` | `string` | Prepends a prefix (e.g., `dev-`) to all resource names to prevent naming collisions. |
| `nameSuffix:` | `string` | Appends a suffix (e.g., `-v1`) to all resource names (useful for blue-green releases). |
| `commonAnnotations:` | `map[string]string` | Injects metadata annotations (`contact`, `team`) across all resources in the overlay. |
| `labels:` (v5) | `[]Label` | Injects labels. Setting `includeSelectors: true` synchronizes deployment matchLabels. |
| `configMapGenerator:` | `[]ConfigMapArgs` | Generates ConfigMaps from literals, key-value files (`files:`), or env-files (`envs:`). |
| `secretGenerator:` | `[]SecretArgs` | Generates Secrets from literals, files, or env-files (`envs:`) with custom `type:`. |
| `generatorOptions:` | `GeneratorOptions` | Tuning: `disableNameSuffixHash: true` disables random hash suffixes on generated names. |
| `images:` | `[]Image` | Dynamically rewrites container image names, tags (`newTag:`), or digests without patches. |
| `patches:` | `[]Patch` | Unified patching syntax supporting strategic merge files and targeted JSON 6902 rules. |

